outOfOrder suppresses none

writeLeft is call
writeLeft in sortInPlace
writeLeft invokes Numbers.set
writeLeft argument list Numbers numbers lendMutable
writeLeft argument index Int64 position copy
writeLeft argument item Int64 rightValue copy
writeLeft result none
writeLeft ownedBy none
writeLeft cleanedBy none
writeLeft borrows none
writeLeft catch writeLeftError list.IndexOutOfRange
writeLeft suppresses none

writeRight is call
writeRight in sortInPlace
writeRight invokes Numbers.set
writeRight argument list Numbers numbers lendMutable
writeRight argument index Int64 following copy
writeRight argument item Int64 leftValue copy
writeRight result none
writeRight ownedBy none
writeRight cleanedBy none
writeRight borrows none
writeRight catch writeRightError list.IndexOutOfRange
writeRight suppresses none

countPass is call
countPass in sortInPlace
countPass invokes math.addInt64
countPass argument left Int64 pass copy
countPass argument right Int64 one copy
countPass result nextPassValue Int64
countPass ownedBy none
countPass cleanedBy none
countPass borrows none
